Package: spaced-welcome
Version: @VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Spaced Linux Team <noreply@spacedlinux.com>
Depends: ca-certificates, flatpak, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, xdg-utils
Recommends: spaced-meta
Homepage: https://github.com/crhy/spacedwelcome
Description: first-run application installer for Spaced Linux
 Shows a source-aware application list on first login, opens the preinstalled
 SpacedBazaar, and installs curated Flatpaks from Flathub and the signed
 Spaced GitHub Flatpak repository.
